{"2457200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gradient Flow", "steam_appid": 2457200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gradient Flow Is A Free-to-Play Minimalist Racing Game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the timer and your friends through leaderboards and online lobbies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradient Flow features a custom physics engine designed to provide the smoothest and the most consistent driving experience possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All playable racetracks are made using the in-game editor and players can easily share their creations and browse other players' creations.<br><br>Customize your wheel with the skins available in the in-game shop!<br>All microtransactions are purely cosmetic and do not give you any advantage in-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gradient Flow Is A Free-to-Play Minimalist Racing Game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the timer and your friends through leaderboards and online lobbies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradient Flow features a custom physics engine designed to provide the smoothest and the most consistent driving experience possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All playable racetracks are made using the in-game editor and players can easily share their creations and browse other players' creations.<br><br>Customize your wheel with the skins available in the in-game shop!<br>All microtransactions are purely cosmetic and do not give you any advantage in-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Gradient Flow Is A Free-to-Play Minimalist Racing Game.Choose from single-player time attack or online multiplayer modes to challenge your skills.Create and share your own racetracks with the community!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2457200/header.jpg?t=1753